	 + yes let s apply{weight=1000}
	 - Great! To start, we need to create your account. For that, we need a few details from you.😋 <call>outputResponses "[[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~]]" "Please tell me your email address. Our councilors will use it to contact you about your application if you're eligible! 😎"</call> {topic=97087218226583280}

	 + tell me more about the undergrad program first{weight=1000}
	 - We prepare our students to be leaders and innovators 💪😎 <call>outputResponses "[[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~]]" "What sets us apart? Let us tell you! 👇 @-LineBreak ⚡We have 40-degree programs @-LineBreak ⚡With a brilliant campus life @-LineBreak ⚡Providing connections to great research opportunities @-LineBreak ⚡At an amazing location in Chicago" "Would you like to start your application now?"</call> <call>displayresoptions "Yes, let's apply!" "What are the requirements?" "Tell me about the steps to apply" "What are the scholarship opportunities?" </call>{topic=241483956108608830}

	 + what are the requirements to apply{weight=1000}
	 - We are looking for the best! Students that are academic, community-oriented, and have good work ethics! 🤓💪 <call>outputResponses "[[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~]]" "We suggest that you complete the following high school courses before applying👇" "👉 4 years of English" "👉 4 years of Mathematics" "👉 3 years of Science" "Would you like to apply now?"</call> <call>displayresoptions "Yes, please!" "Tell me about the undergrad program" "What are the scholarship prospects?" "What are the steps to apply?" </call>{topic=524031584978258100}

	 + what are the steps to apply{weight=1000}
	 - There are multiple steps involved to secure an admission in our university 👇 <call>outputResponses "[[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~]]" "STEP 1: APPLICATION FOR ADMISSION" "Which I can help you with right away 🤗"</call> <call>displayresoptions "Next Step" </call>{topic=534834478422229200}

	 + tell me about scholarships{weight=1000}
	 - Illinois Tech offers both need-based financial aid and merit-based scholarships. 💪💰🤑 <call>outputResponses "[[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~],[|6^9~0|6^9~]]" "You can also apply for the priority scholarship (deadline December 1st) to receive the most Illinois Tech scholarship funds! 😍" "Would you like to apply now?"</call> <call>displayresoptions "Yes, please!" "Tell me about the undergrad program" "What are the scholarship prospects?" "What are the steps to apply?" </call>{topic=524031584978258100}
